    "id": "tale-of-two-cities-world",
    "name": "A Tale of Two Cities",
    "description": "Charles Dickens’s story of London and Paris follows Lucie Manette, Charles Darnay, and Sydney Carton from a private resurrection in 1775 through the French Revolution. Family love, inherited violence, political judgment, and chosen sacrifice bind the two cities as lives are recalled, condemned, exchanged, and carried into the future.",
