      "number": 15,
      "title": "Book the Second — The Golden Thread: The Gorgon’s Head",
      "synopsis": "At the château, Darnay tells his uncle he will not continue a system built on fear and suffering. At dawn the household finds the marquis stabbed, with Gaspard’s message fixed to the knife.",
      "notes": "",
      "wordGoal": null
    },
