      "timelineId": "tale-of-two-cities-timeline-main",
      "number": 30,
      "title": "Book the Second — The Golden Thread: Drawn to the Loadstone Rock",
      "synopsis": "At Tellson’s, Darnay reads the imprisoned agent’s plea and decides he must go secretly to Paris. Darnay departs without asking consent, believing a written explanation can contain the danger.",
