      "number": 43,
      "title": "Book the Third — The Track of a Storm: Fifty-two",
      "synopsis": "Inside the Conciergerie, Carton drugs Darnay, changes identities through clothing, and has Barsad carry the unconscious prisoner out. Lorry drives the unconscious Darnay, Lucie, Little Lucie, Manette, and Pross’s arranged luggage toward the city gate.",
