      "timelineId": "tale-of-two-cities-timeline-main",
      "number": 44,
      "title": "Book the Third — The Track of a Storm: The Knitting Done",
      "synopsis": "Madame Defarge goes to the lodgings to find evidence that will keep Lucie and her child from escaping. During their struggle Madame Defarge’s pistol fires, killing her, while the blast permanently deafens Miss Pross.",
